00:40:15,025 --> 00:40:17,025
-Police. Everyone out of the vehicle!
-Dad!

526
00:40:17,105 --> 00:40:18,305
-Dad, I'm here!
-Out!

527
00:40:18,385 --> 00:40:19,625
Dad, I'm here!

528
00:40:20,825 --> 00:40:22,425
-Run him over.
-Dad!

529
00:40:23,345 --> 00:40:25,065
-Help!
-Step on the gas!

530
00:40:25,145 --> 00:40:26,985
-He's a cop.
-You chickened out?

531
00:40:27,065 --> 00:40:27,985
All of you, out!

532
00:40:28,065 --> 00:40:28,945
-Run him over!
-Dad!

533
00:40:29,025 --> 00:40:29,905
Help!

534
00:40:29,985 --> 00:40:30,945
Quick!

535
00:40:32,985 --> 00:40:34,785
Dad! Dad!

536
00:40:42,505 --> 00:40:44,265
-Get out!
-Help me!

537
00:40:44,345 --> 00:40:46,505
Get out! Get out!

538
00:40:46,585 --> 00:40:47,865
Move!

539
00:40:48,665 --> 00:40:50,105
-Don't hit my dad!
-Move!

540
00:40:50,185 --> 00:40:51,945
