541
00:40:53,105 --> 00:40:53,985
Out of my way!

542
00:40:54,785 --> 00:40:56,065
Don't hit my dad!

543
00:40:56,145 --> 00:40:57,945
I won't forgive you!

544
00:41:00,905 --> 00:41:02,985
-Step on it.
-Don't hit my dad!

545
00:41:03,065 --> 00:41:04,465
Run him over!

546
00:41:09,025 --> 00:41:10,465
Dad!

547
00:41:10,545 --> 00:41:11,705
Dad!

